## User Approved & Meeting Verified Checklist

- ✅ **Sales Attribution**: Salesman for reporting only (no commission logic). Direct counter sales attributed to current logged-in user.
- ✅ **Returns**: Always against original invoice (invoice remains unedited, separate return record created).
- ✅ **Condition Valuation**: Return refund value for altered item condition (NEW → USED) manually set by staff.
- ✅ **Exchange**: Multiple old items IN + multiple new items OUT supported. Positive difference = Customer Pays; Negative difference = Shop Pays; Zero difference = No Settlement.
- ✅ **Trade-In / Buyback**: Standalone Trade-In module removed. Customer buyback treated as **Daily Customer Purchase** (Inventory Purchase Intake).
- ✅ **Costing**: Moving Average Cost per pool (`Product + Location + Condition`) for serialized & non-serialized stock. Quick-add unknown products with `Name + Cost + Category`.
- ✅ **Customer Khata**: Primary lookup by phone number; customer ID backend key; multi-invoice payment allocation supported.
- ✅ **Payment / Refund**: Allowed methods (Cash, Card, Bank, Online). Store Credit removed everywhere. Physical cash drawer tracks cash only.
- ✅ **Daily Report**: 15 required stat cards.
- ✅ **Data Safety & Integrity**: Cancellation triggers atomic rollback. Completed records never hard-deleted (audit reversal entries used).

