### Business Logic Engines

#### [NEW] [averageCostEngine.ts](file:///d:/PGS-IMS-main/lib/averageCostEngine.ts)
- Centralized moving average cost calculation:
  `newAvgCost = (existingQty * existingAvg + intakeQty * intakeUnitCost) / (existingQty + intakeQty)`
- Replaces FIFO layer logic.

#### [MODIFY] [customerLedgerEngine.ts](file:///d:/PGS-IMS-main/lib/customerLedgerEngine.ts)
- Remove store credit handling.
- Support multi-invoice allocation entries in customer ledger.

#### [MODIFY] [salesEngine.ts](file:///d:/PGS-IMS-main/lib/salesEngine.ts)
- Update sale creation to attribute direct counter sales to current logged-in user if salesman not provided.
- Sale completion uses pool `averageCost` for COGS calculation.

