### API Endpoints

#### [MODIFY] [returns route.ts](file:///d:/PGS-IMS-main/app/api/sales/returns/route.ts)
- Backend handler for `RETURN` and `EXCHANGE` against historical invoices.
- Supports manual return value override per item if condition is degraded (NEW → USED/DEFECTIVE).
- Enforces multi-item processing (`returnedItems[]`, `replacementItems[]`).
- Calculates net difference:
  - `difference > 0`: Customer Pays (Cash, Card, Bank, Online, Split)
  - `difference < 0`: Shop Pays / Refund (Cash, Card, Bank, Online, Split)
  - `difference === 0`: No Settlement
- Executed within MongoDB transaction session with idempotency locking.

